<Base title="Kessik terms of use" description="The terms for using the Kessik iPhone app.">
  <h1>Terms of use</h1>
  <p class="meta">Effective October 16, 2026</p>

  <p>
    These terms cover your use of Kessik, an iPhone app by Zach Short ("the developer"). By using the
    app you agree to them. Apple's standard Licensed Application End User License Agreement also
