  <h2>What the app does</h2>
  <p>
    Kessik is an SSH client. It connects to computers that you choose and runs commands on them for
    you, including tmux and Claude Code. It does not provide a server, an account or Claude access.
    Claude Code is a separate product from Anthropic and has its own terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Your responsibility</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Connect only to computers that you own or have permission to use.</li>
    <li>Keep your devices, SSH keys and passwords secure. You are responsible for what runs on your Mac through the app, including actions that Claude Code takes.</li>
    <li>Check each host key change before you trust it.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>Do not use Kessik to access systems without permission, to break the law or to harm others.</p>

  <h2>No warranty</h2>
