    To the extent the law allows, the developer is not liable for lost data, lost work or other
    indirect damage that comes from using the app, including commands that run on your computers.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>The developer may update these terms. The new version will appear on this page with a new effective date. Continued use means you accept the update.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions go to <a href="mailto:support@kessik.com">support@kessik.com</a>. See also the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.</p>
</Base>
